notes.content:
Hey everyone!

A Plague Tale: Requiem has just been showcased at The Game Awards 2022, an annual awards ceremony honoring achievements in the video game industry. We're incredibly thankful to be part of such an amazing event, among so many amazing games!

For the occasion, here's The Game Awards 2022 Spolight trailer showcased at the event:
[previewyoutube=MTskFVe8P3Q;full][/previewyoutube]

A Plague Tale: Requiem’s nominations at The Game Awards 2022 are:
Game of the Year, recognizing a game that delivers the absolute best experience across all creative and technical fields;
Best Action/Adventure, for the best action/adventure game, combining combat with traversal and puzzle solving;
Best Narrative, for outstanding storytelling and narrative development in a game;
Best Score and Music (Olivier Derivière), for outstanding music, inclusive of score, original song and/or licensed soundtrack;
Best Performance (Charlotte McBurney – Amicia), awarded to an individual for voice-over acting, motion and/or performance capture

Thank you so much everyone. You make us so proud.

🤎
